ore", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SwissPaulyShore/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 663, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 658, "last_played": 1719077699, "avatar": "4127629d3c1dc9a21c61ff9d3c0b662535b40552"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is fun but it has plenty of flows.\n\nLack of in game chat is my biggest pet peeve.  You cannot type into a chat or use voice.  It takes away a TON of potential.  Matchmaking once you beat the campaign and unlock quick match helps with it taking forever to find people to play with.  \n\nOverall the game feels kind of half done.  Havent bought the DLC, but I doubt that fixes some of the core issues with the game.  Campaign is kind of short but okayish for replayability.\n\nWhen it comes to this style of game I think killing floor, vermintide, and even world war Z do it better.", "timestamp_created": 1719010973, "timestamp_updated": 1719011234, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167862859", "author": {"steamid": "76561199134768632", "personaname": "nemesis resident evil", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PacifistJerk/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 46, "playtime_forever": 30, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 30, "last_played": 1718999659, "avatar": "a51d9176af074af1b8f4801911f2daa2b75f562c"}, "language": "english", "review": "i personally didn't have fun with the game", "timestamp_created": 1718999722, "timestamp_updated": 1718999722, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.500986218452453613", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_